# Optional. Where the Staging tab's "Manage stacks" button points.
# Start, stop, restart and logs live in Dockge (or Portainer) on the staging
# host, reached over Tailscale. Nightjar only *shows* stacks; it never controls
# them. Leave blank to hide the button.
#
# Vite bakes this into the built page, so it must not be a secret. A Tailscale
# address is fine; a URL with credentials in it is not.
VITE_STACK_CONTROL_URL=
